- [`SettingsPage`](client/src/pages/SettingsPage.tsx) (General) — shell width; tab placement exception above
- [`SeoGeoSettingsPage`](client/src/pages/SeoGeoSettingsPage.tsx) — header + top-right tabs (canonical)
- [`AISettingsPage`](client/src/pages/AISettingsPage.tsx)
- [`SecurityPage`](client/src/pages/SecurityPage.tsx) — header + top-right tabs
- [`TrackingPage`](client/src/pages/TrackingPage.tsx) — header + top-right tabs (same shell)
- [`McpServerPage`](client/src/pages/McpServerPage.tsx) — header + top-right tabs (Connection / Tools)
- [`AgentsOrgChartPage`](client/src/pages/AgentsOrgChartPage.tsx) — page-heading advanced popover exemplar; header + top-right tabs (Org Chart / Proposals)

Sibling admin surfaces (Background Pipeline, Diagnostics) may use a different width when the content warrants it; do not copy their shell onto Settings pages. New third-party cards on those surfaces still follow **Test connection** above.
